{"code":"th-TH","name":"Thai","native":"ไทย","badge":"ไทย","tts":"th-TH","about":"Add ครับ (khráp, men) or ค่ะ (khâ, women) to the end of any line to be polite.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"ไม่เข้าใจ","say":"mâi khâo jai","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"ไม่รู้","say":"mâi rúu","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"รอสักครู่","say":"ror sàk khrûu","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"พูดอีกทีได้ไหม","say":"phûut ìik thii dâi mǎi","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"พูดช้าๆ หน่อย","say":"phûut cháa cháa nòi","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"“…” ภาษาไทยพูดว่าอะไร","say":"… phaa-sǎa thai phûut wâa a-rai","en":"How do you say “…” in Thai?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"},{"id":"x.C11","t":"…ครับ / …ค่ะ","say":"…khráp / …khâ","en":"Polite ending for any line (men: khráp · women: khâ)"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"ได้เลย","say":"dâi loei","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"ใช่เลย","say":"châi loei","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"คิดว่าใช่","say":"khít wâa châi","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"จริงเหรอ","say":"jing rǒe","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"ไม่เป็นไร","say":"mâi pen rai","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok","hook":"The Thai motto: never mind, it’s fine."},{"id":"c2.6","t":"ดีจัง","say":"dii jang","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x}อยู่ที่ไหน","say":"{x} yùu thîi nǎi","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"ขอ{x}","say":"khǒr {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"],"lit":"may-I-have {x}"},{"id":"c3.3","t":"มี{x}ไหม","say":"mii {x} mǎi","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"ขอ{x}หน่อย","say":"khǒr {x} nòi","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"ต้องไปแล้ว","say":"tông pai láew","en":"I have to go.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"เข้าไปได้ไหม","say":"khâo pai dâi mǎi","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"เดี๋ยวเช็กให้","say":"dǐao chék hâi","en":"I’ll check for you.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"มีประชุม","say":"mii pra-chum","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"เผ็ดไหม","say":"phèt mǎi","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"ไม่ใส่หัวหอม","say":"mâi sài hǔa hǒrm","en":"No onion."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"แนะนำอะไรดี","say":"náe-nam a-rai dii","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"ไม่กินเนื้อสัตว์","say":"mâi gin núea sàt","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"เท่าไหร่","say":"thâo-rài","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"ดูเฉยๆ","say":"duu chǒei chǒei","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"เอาอันนี้","say":"ao an níi","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"จ่ายบัตรได้ไหม","say":"jàai bàt dâi mǎi","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"ไกลไหม","say":"glai mǎi","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"ไปสนามบิน","say":"pai sa-nǎam bin","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"ซ้าย · ขวา · ตรงไป","say":"sáai · khwǎa · trong pai","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"ช่วยด้วย","say":"chûai dûai","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"ไม่มีกระดาษทิชชู่","say":"mâi mii gra-dàat thít-chûu","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"รู้สึกไม่สบาย","say":"rúu-sùek mâi sa-baai","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"ช่วยเรียกรถพยาบาลหน่อย","say":"chûai rîak rót pha-yaa-baan nòi","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"ยินดีที่ได้รู้จัก","say":"yin-dii thîi dâi rúu-jàk","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"มาจากไหน","say":"maa jàak nǎi","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"ทำงานอะไร","say":"tham ngaan a-rai","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"อร่อยมาก","say":"a-ròi mâak","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"สวัสดี","say":"sa-wàt-dii","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"อรุณสวัสดิ์","say":"a-run sa-wàt","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"สบายดีไหม","say":"sa-baai dii mǎi","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"ใช่ · ไม่ใช่","say":"châi · mâi châi","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"กรุณา","say":"ga-ru-naa","en":"Please. (formal, on signs)"},{"id":"b1.6","t":"ขอบคุณ","say":"khàwp khun","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"ขอโทษ","say":"khǒr thôot","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"ลาก่อน","say":"laa gòrn","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"หนึ่ง · สอง · สาม","say":"nùeng · sǒrng · sǎam","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"สี่ · ห้า · หก","say":"sìi · hâa · hòk","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"เจ็ด · แปด · เก้า","say":"jèt · pàet · gâo","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"สิบ · ยี่สิบ · ร้อย","say":"sìp · yîi-sìp · rói","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"แอปเปิ้ลสีแดง","say":"áep-pôen sǐi daeng","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is”, no “the” · words never change form"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"ฉันกินแอปเปิ้ล","say":"chǎn gin áep-pôen","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"same order as English"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"ฉันกินแอปเปิ้ลแล้ว","say":"chǎn gin áep-pôen láew","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"แล้ว (láew) at the end = done / past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"ฉันอยากกินแอปเปิ้ล","say":"chǎn yàak gin áep-pôen","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"อยาก (yàak) + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"คุณกินแอปเปิ้ลไหม","say":"khun gin áep-pôen mǎi","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"ไหม (mǎi) at the end asks yes/no"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"ห้องน้ำ","say":"hông náam","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"ร้านขายยา","say":"ráan khǎai yaa","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"โรงพยาบาล","say":"rong pha-yaa-baan","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"สถานี","say":"sa-thǎa-nii","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"สนามบิน","say":"sa-nǎam bin","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"โรงแรม","say":"rong raem","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"น้ำ","say":"náam","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"กาแฟ","say":"gaa-fae","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"เช็กบิล","say":"chék bin","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"เมนู","say":"mee-nuu","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"เบียร์","say":"bia","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"อันนี้","say":"an níi","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"ถุง","say":"thǔng","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"ประชุม","say":"pra-chum","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"ไฟล์","say":"fai","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"หน้าจอ","say":"nâa jor","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"ข้อความ","say":"khôr-khwaam","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"พรุ่งนี้","say":"phrûng-níi","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"}],"diet":{"title":"แพ้อาหาร · กรุณาอ่าน","ask":"อาหารนี้มีส่วนผสมเหล่านี้ไหม","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"ขอบคุณมาก","note":"Fish sauce (น้ำปลา) and shrimp paste are in most dishes. เจ (jay) is the strict vegan option.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"ฉันแพ้ถั่วลิสงอย่างรุนแรง กินถั่วลิสงและน้ำมันถั่วลิสงไม่ได้","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"ฉันแพ้อาหารทะเลอย่างรุนแรง (กุ้ง ปู หอย)","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"ฉันกินกลูเตนไม่ได้ (แป้งสาลี)","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"ฉันกินมังสวิรัติ ไม่กินเนื้อสัตว์ ไก่ ปลา และไม่ใส่น้ำปลา","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"ฉันไม่กินหมู","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"ห้องน้ำ","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"ชาย · หญิง","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"ทางออก · ทางเข้า","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ผลัก · ดึง","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"ทางออกฉุกเฉิน","en":"Emergency exit"}]}